  "system": {
    "localizationKey": "",
    "description": "<p>Applies Mental Strain to the target, with a 35% chance to start a Mental Duel. On a Critical Success the duel always starts, and the target may accept one voluntarily.</p><p>For the duration the caster is forced to Slow Movement and takes a -20% penalty to Success, except on the Mental Duel itself and on Will tests.</p><p>The caster cannot cast this on the same target again for an hour.</p>",
